WEBVTT
NOTE Dawn Chorus: captions (sound cues).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Near silence. A soft, steady breeze]

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[A single bird whistles a falling two-note call, several times]

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
[A second bird joins with a quick, rising trill]

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
[A distant bell rings three times]

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Many birds call over one another — the full dawn chorus]

6
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
[The calls thin out and the breeze fades]
